14,8,"practice, start, unbalanced, use, constructively",leo (25.0%),"8732, 8762, 10472, 10502, 12212, 12242, 13952, 13982","When you feel unbalanced it's a little more upsetting than it is for other people. For instance, whe...","When you feel unbalanced it's a little more upsetting than it is for other people. For instance, when you break the routine in your exercise practice you tend to feel the effects quite strongly. You can use this sensitivity constructively. If you need to start a health practice and have trouble getting motivated, all you need to do is start and the energy rush you will get will make you want more right away. Use this momentum to build a health regimen. When you feel unbalanced it's a little more upsetting than it is for other people. For instance, when you break the routine in your exercise practice you tend to feel the effects quite strongly. You can use this sensitivity constructively. If you need to start a health practice and have trouble getting motivated, all you need to do is start and the energy rush you will get will make you want more right away. Use this momentum to build a health regimen. When you feel unbalanced it's a little more upsetting than it is for other people. For instance, when you break the routine in your exercise practice you tend to feel the effects quite strongly. You can use this sensitivity constructively. If you need to start a health practice and have trouble getting motivated, all you need to do is start and the energy rush you will get will make you want more right away. Use this momentum to build a health regimen. When you feel unbalanced it's a little more upsetting than it is for other people. For instance, when you break the routine in your exercise practice you tend to feel the effects quite strongly. You can use this sensitivity constructively. If you need to start a health practice and have trouble getting motivated, all you need to do is start and the energy rush you will get will make you want more