1021,4,"things, deep, currents, casserole, vegetable",aries (25.0%),"1365, 3105, 4845, 21585","Keep things light today, in almost every area. Balance the deep with the superficial: water the plan...","Keep things light today, in almost every area. Balance the deep with the superficial: water the plants, do the laundry, and clean the kitchen while you sense the emotional currents that run deep. Things need to ""gestate"" in your unconscious until they are ready to come up. I recommend taking an easy walk for exercise or swimming a few laps. Concentrate on the preparation of healthy meals such as vegetable soup or a vegetarian casserole. Notice the beauty in humble things. Keep things light today, in almost every area. Balance the deep with the superficial: water the plants, do the laundry, and clean the kitchen while you sense the emotional currents that run deep. Things need to ""gestate"" in your unconscious until they are ready to come up. I recommend taking an easy walk for exercise or swimming a few laps. Concentrate on the preparation of healthy meals such as vegetable soup or a vegetarian casserole. Notice the beauty in humble things. Keep things light today, in almost every area. Balance the deep with the superficial: water the plants, do the laundry, and clean the kitchen while you sense the emotional currents that run deep. Things need to ""gestate"" in your unconscious until they are ready to come up. I recommend taking an easy walk for exercise or swimming a few laps. Concentrate on the preparation of healthy meals such as vegetable soup or a vegetarian casserole. Notice the beauty in humble things. Keep things light today, in almost every area. Balance the deep with the superficial: water the plants, do the laundry, and clean the kitchen while you sense the emotional currents that run deep. Things need to ""gestate"" in your unconscious until they are ready to come up. I recommend taking an easy walk for exercise or swimming a few laps. Concentrate on th